{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p028a","title":"荀粲与荀俣论象意言辞","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p028a-account","label":"何劭《粲传》","text":"荀粲与荀俣论象意言辞","evidence":["xunyu-e-p028a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0062","role":"论学","evidence":["xunyu-e-p028a-q"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0052","role":"论学","evidence":["xunyu-e-p028a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"荀粲生平","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-p028a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-p028a-q","source_order":[10,187,"P028a"],"order":2463}],"persons":[{"id":"xunyu-p0052","name":"荀俣","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xunyu-p0062","name":"荀粲","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p028a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-13b02a969d44d8988667","layer":"pei","quote":"粲字奉倩。粲诸兄并以儒术论议，而粲独好言道；常以为：‘子贡称夫子之言性与天道，不可得闻；然则六籍虽存，固圣人之糠秕。’粲兄俣难曰：‘《易》亦云圣人立象以尽意，系辞焉以尽言；则微言，胡为不可得而闻见哉？’粲答曰：‘盖理之微者，非物象之所举也。今称立象以尽意，此非通于意外者也；系辞焉以尽言，此非言乎系表者也；斯则象外之意，系表之言，固蕴而不出矣。’及当时能言者，不能屈也。","attribution":"何劭《粲传》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5921d94ec8d8ad2b9baa","start":10,"end":195,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
